      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still in the staff room at Claude Monet, Nastya has heard Sasha's revenge plan: start seeing Kostya, Max's best friend. Nervously, she says yes. Sasha is sure it will work, because she has noticed how Kostya looks at Nastya. Here it is in Russian.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
